  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO INCREASE THE USE OF INFORMATION AND TECHNOLOGYY IN THE PRIVATE AND PUBLIC SECTOR, AND THUS INCREASE THE COMPETITIVENESS OF THE ECONOMY. THE COMPONENTS OF THE PROJECT ARE: (A) STRENGTHENING THE COMMUNICATIONS AND INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY OFFICE (CITO); (B) ENHANCING E GOVERNMENT; AND (C) INCREASING COMMUNITY OUTREACH.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
